Z||000000||Haze_Performance||08-03-2000||10:53 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> If you bid on Fiero part's on Ebay BEWARE of this guy. User Name: "fiero69-1@excite.com"<BR>I won a 3rd Brake Light on June 19 2000 and he wont send it. Goto: <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=354045575&r=0&t=0" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=354045575&r=0&t=0</A>   to see the auction. After me sending 25 emails he reply's to me 4 times. He kept finding problems with shipping. The last I heard he was going to overnight it to me a week ago. I just wanted to warn you before you bid  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> <P><BR>Thanks<BR>Carl<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg"> My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe<P><BR>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||8
Z||000001||deceler8||08-03-2000||01:06 PM||||If you paid him via PayPal, you may be able to get a refund from PayPal.<P>They have started a program where you can apply for restitution in cases of fraud or problems such as yours.||||reg||1
Z||000002||tgowens||08-03-2000||01:21 PM||||Haze, I notice he has a low feedback rating too and if you red them closely you will see that most of them are from people he bought from not sold to.....seems he has a selling problem!! -- contact eBay about him too - they don't like that kinda thing!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||mbramble||08-03-2000||01:37 PM||||His name is Robert Daneels (sp?) and he has been the subject of several discussions on the Fiero mailing list.  Someone even went so far as to contact everyone who bid on any of his items, for awhile, to let them know what a scum he is.  <P>I eventually received my item, after having to put up with a tirade about how he 'don't scr@w nobody' and some of the worst language you have ever seen in an e-mail.  Guess I was one of the lucky ones.....<P>This is the 3rd known 'handle' he has used on e-bay.||||reg||1
Z||000004||tgowens||08-03-2000||02:14 PM||||mbramble, I thought I had heard about him before -- he changed his I.D. when his feedback was a minus a whole bunch!! It's a shame that there are people like him in this world but, it's a good thing that this forum is here so that others can be aware of what has happened to others. Personally, I have had several dealings with forum members and find it a much nicer group of people to deal with than a lot of eBayers (and I have been a buyer/seller on eBay for three years!)<P>Thanks again for for the "heads up"!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Rodney||08-03-2000||02:28 PM||||Can ebay be notified and told that he keeps ripping people off and he keeps changing his email address to cover it up. Possibly they can take some action?||||reg||1
Z||000006||mrfixit58||08-03-2000||03:14 PM||||This kinda thing is truly a shame. I often sell on eBay and I always post under the same name as here "mrfixit58". I notice a couple of other members who do the same thing. If I can figure how it's done, I may start listing the "Pennock's" banner on future ads. Kinda of a "quality assurance" thing. So far, I haven't been burned... buying or selling. Hope my luck holds out.<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||2M4 Dale||08-04-2000||09:21 AM||||I sell on ebay too. My handle on ebay is my email address...the same one I use here. I have only had a couple of problems but they sure are frustrating. Another thing that bothers me is that feedback thing. I always leave feedback wether buying or selling. I think it should somehow be mandatory. But once again ebay buyer beware !!!||||reg||1
